\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. GREAT is the Lord our God,
\par And let His praise be great;
\par He makes His churches His abode,
\par His most delightful seat.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. These temples of His grace,
\par How beautiful they stand!
\par The honours of our native place,
\par And bulwarks of our land.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In Zion God is known,
\par A refuge in distress,
\par How bright has His salvation shone
\par Through all her palaces!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. In every new distress
\par We'll to His house repair;
\par We'll think upon His wondrous grace,
\par And seek deliverance there.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

